# Authoring is TypeScript only. Codegen writes `.ts` into `src/`; `tsc`
# emits into `dist/`. Never keep compiled JS next to the sources — a stray
# in-place emit (wrong cwd / missing outDir) has already staged these once.
src/**/*.js
src/**/*.js.map
src/**/*.d.ts
src/**/*.d.ts.map

# Local install noise; the published package ships `dist/` only.
node_modules/
